@startuml
start
:Client opens chat widget;
:Chatbot asks for email and issue type;
if (Can chatbot resolve the issue?) then (Yes)
:Chatbot provides knowledge base article;
:Client confirms resolution;
else (No)
:Client requests human operator;
:System evaluates routing rules;
if (Is matching Operator available?) then (Yes)
:Assign Conversation to Operator;
:Operator receives incoming chat notification;
else (No)
:Add Conversation to Department Queue;
:Display wait time to Client;
:Wait for Operator to become available;
:Assign Conversation to Operator;
endif
:Operator joins chat session;
:Operator and Client exchange messages;
:Operator resolves issue;
endif
:Close Conversation;
:Send CSAT Survey to Client;
stop
@enduml